      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能够跳级，除了她本身实力优异外，\n也因为我们判断她已经开始\n进入“巅峰期”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33d352126c7e40d976047abc910cc6442811ab6394184ae7f6d95ec1d45b8790",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
