    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bb2035e7a29797732b4fc53",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "巅峰期，也可称为赛马娘的成长期，\n当选手进入颠峰期，从事职业运动所需的能力\n将会出现跳跃性成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24105376939aa83aa104363cd7b115f6c5f361dd9f9e31945299120ef765e904",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1051/storytimeline_501051100.json",
