      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是说，\n现在西野花同学的跑步表现\n已经足以参加竞赛，不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "18b2aca1980e43b2086fa2a246bbba7c772cca23c7aca1d0eae09b7bc4b05957",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
