      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，记得入学前我们也向西野花同学\n还有你父母解释过了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f27d15be599c64a5e665d0fd25a377d0cd1847dbc7f8c66b2c7785fcbd2be10c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
