      "uid": "zhcn:da8a6d933b76143cd7402523",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，\n这孩子“接下来”正要开始发育。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdb8835bd9e12a181d2be15cd9b7affea31dbf8e4d146866fe3fabf6e4870511",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
