      "uid": "zhcn:aa9d224b4fe4d9ffea6aea13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，一切安排都请务必配合她的身体状况。\n容我再次拜托，\n还请你多多照顾这孩子了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "200379d54b401a6f3c5de713b9732b7e75d82cf5bcbe30a331a9e119250bd170",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1051/storytimeline_501051100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e192b4952466f47de4109d9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以年龄来说，她还只是个小学生。\n跟同时期出道的选手比起来，\n体格当然会输人一截。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e3f1c25d2caedb6cf887e2ca779ebd74d3ffa9695e7ebed8b69cb19a129abc0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1051/storytimeline_501051100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de04bebc5ce26bfa4dedbc5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "往后这个不利条件\n甚至可能对她产生重大影响，不过现在──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8055f742bc64f567221849c22e8ec71e956f03ba53b45d95c6baf7cb8eaa278d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1051/storytimeline_501051100.json",
      "json_path": [
