    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c52115a25afd58a33bbbea8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是，要跑步还是没问题的……对吧？\n我会努力进行训练，\n弥补自己不足的地方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d810701fd2642a721ed559191fe6cc99fe99c4cd3cc886650f0dbd3d20698c13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
